      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16796/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove squash from the oven and transfer one squash half, cut-side up, to a deep baking dish. Spoon butter and brown sugar into the cavity. Place remaining squash half, cut-side down, over top to seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dO6KjeVrdFLgUN3HwfFWILSsLmo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16796-acorn-squash-step-4-53-86ba8cacb0944a659204b1e098da961f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16796/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to the oven and continue to bake until flesh is soft, 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
